<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Investing.com daily close data, June 15 to July 14 2026. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
